## Metadata
Copyright: New York World
Date: 1914-01-18
Number: 5
Notes: A 13-wide diamond with a shaded cross in the centre printed "CAN YOU SOLVE IT?" (shown as _); two words, 33-34 and 35-36, run down the centre column above and below the cross. The number is printed in the heading ("FUN'S CROSS-WORD PUZZLE, NO. 5."). No credit is printed. Read by hand from the Milwaukee Sentinel's page (Milwaukee_Sentinel_1914_01_18_81_fun.png), solution from Milwaukee_Sentinel_1914_01_25_68_key.png, by Claude, 2026-11-16.


